// local-puls-api/src/lib/botWelcome.js
//
// The bot's first message to a new user, one per app language.
//
// FIXED TEXT, NOT AI. The welcome is sent at signup, before the user has said
// anything — so nothing about them goes to the AI provider until they choose
// to reply. The second sentence is the disclosure: it tells them, in their own
// language, that replies are AI-generated by a third party. That is what
// App Review guideline 5.1.2(i) asks for, so do not shorten it away.

